    reader("List", "listCharges", "List charges, newest first. Filter by customer, payment_intent and created[gte]/created[lte] (UNIX seconds); page with starting_after = the last id while has_more. Amounts are in the smallest currency unit. expand[] inlines related objects (e.g. data.customer)."),
